967146720044_7348271922241027561_n.png", "id": "1622106927959774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_1622106931293107_7673111564532441971_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P_WIKQpzv_gQ7kNvwEzCD--&_nc_oc=AdpqrBFCSKErJwX0oPrT_I3w3Mva2sNk8lCps6vIDkV4tatmCaBEj4hCNWFl0FZRVuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRvahi6nFH4ZDzi8f7zOLC7XYb4HbBBsGa7olJSFtOGrg&oe=6B0C73A8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974909_908434023259504_3985756054659184676_n.png", "id": "925778641641882", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974738_925778644975215_4153897081312316798_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyqT8CileqoQ7kNvwGiPasa&_nc_oc=AdpijYUhNfyytZgxmkvDkDkJTCoK5-V6w47GiFe13Lc33AeN6DgWVbUYp28ppf-Cj0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQkDOg72wlG3j7TN_-9CpXjmyTxC7bkSszvf9LCyrAbJw&oe=6B0C5103"}, "display_name": "Magical Journey", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Millions of players of all ages have already loved the classic Match-3 game mechanics. Now you have a chance to dive deeper into these fantastic mechanics with the help of virtual reality. Line up three or more identical elements in a row, swapping two adjacent elements of the playing field. What could be easier? And what could be more joyful? \n\nForget about the real world and get immersed in a relaxing and calm magical atmosphere.\nExplore a bizarre world filled with a network of ancient magic portals.\n", "short_description": "Magical Journey is a mysterious world of adventures, full of ancient portals and relaxing surroundings based on classic match-3 mechanics. You play as Wizard, who is creating spells by means of runes, and with a magic wave of the wand, you are supposed to adjust ancient portals that open the path to marvelous new worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv